@prefix cepio: <https://cepio.org/ontology/core#> .
@prefix life: <https://cepio.org/ontology/lifecycle#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

life:LifecycleStage a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:State .
life:Concept a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:FEED a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Engineering a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Procurement a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Construction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Commissioning a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Operation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Maintenance a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:Decommissioning a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf life:LifecycleStage .
life:hasLifecycleStage a owl:ObjectProperty .
